OL,3,GNEWSAMP asks for medical exemptions to
OL,4,Atourist tax plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called on the government to
OL,7,Fintroduce an exemption to tourist tax
OL,8,Fproposals for those staying in
OL,9,Fovernight accommodation for medical
OL,10,Freasons.
OL,12,FLocal leaders are set to gain new
OL,13,Fpowers to charge an uncapped levy,
OL,14,Fdubbed a "tourist tax", as a percentage
OL,15,Fof the cost of hotels, bed and
OL,16,Fbreakfasts and other types of
OL,17,Faccommodation.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
PN,36402
