OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1791041131
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMP asks for medical exemptions to
OL,4,Atourist tax plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlicia Kearns, Conservative MP for
OL,7,FRutland and Stamford, said her husband
OL,8,Fhad to stay in hotels when their
OL,9,Ffour-month-old daughter had brain
OL,10,Fsurgery at Great Ormond Street
OL,11,FHospital.
OL,13,FKearns said that for families "facing
OL,14,Fthe hardest time of their lives", an
OL,15,F"additional cost burden put on them is
OL,16,Fjust not acceptable, unforgivable".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
